                                                                                                                                   MOC306XM, MOC316XM — 6-Pin DIP Zero-Cross Phototriac Driver Optocoupler (600 Volt Peak)
                                                                                                         September 2010



     MOC3061M, MOC3062M, MOC3063M,
     MOC3162M, MOC3163M
     6-Pin DIP Zero-Cross Phototriac Driver Optocoupler
     (600 Volt Peak)
     Features                                                 Description
     ■ Simplifies logic control of 115/240 VAC power          The MOC306XM and MOC316XM devices consist of a
     ■ Zero voltage crossing                                  GaAs infrared emitting diode optically coupled to a
     ■ dv/dt of 1000V/µs guaranteed (MOC316X-M),
                                                              monolithic silicon detector performing the function of a
                                                              zero voltage crossing bilateral triac driver. They are
        – 600V/µs guaranteed (MOC306X-M)
                                                              designed for use with a triac in the interface of logic sys-
     ■ VDE recognized (File # 94766)                          tems to equipment powered from 115/240 VAC lines,
        – ordering option V (e.g., MOC3063V-M)                such as solid-state relays, industrial controls, motors,
     ■ Underwriters Laboratories (UL) recognized              solenoids and consumer appliances, etc.
        (File #E90700, volume 2)

     Applications
     ■ Solenoid/valve controls
     ■ Static power switches
     ■ Temperature controls
     ■ AC motor starters
     ■ Lighting controls
     ■ AC motor drives
     ■ E.M. contactors
     ■ Solid state relays


